      "nets": ["/VCP_pH", "/VCP_NA", "/VCP_NB", "+24V", "GND"],
      "observed": "The TMC2209 charge-pump capacitors are connected from the VCP pins to the +24V motor rail instead of to GND: C49 pin 1 is on /VCP_pH and pin 2 is on +24V, C50 pin 1 is on /VCP_NA and pin 2 is on +24V, and C51 pin 1 is on /VCP_NB and pin 2 is on +24V.",
