        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"C49\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"C49\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"VCP\") (pintype \"output\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The high-side gate-drive charge pump on each TMC2209 is likely not referenced correctly, which can prevent the stepper dosing-pump drivers from operating properly or cause erratic/failed pump drive.",
      "confidence": 0.72
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The board connectivity otherwise matches the documented OPNhydro-r2 architecture, but the three TMC2209 VCP capacitors are tied to +24V rather than GND, which is a likely design/assembly anomaly affecting the dosing-pump drivers."
}

